[454.357356, "o", "- Added `permissions: contents: write` (least privilege) instead of the default broad token.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - Kept `on: workflow_dispatch` so the workflow can be run manually as well.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
